msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As if the world ending and you being stranded on some flying island away from"
" everything wasn't bad enough, you now feel a growing hunger for the blood of"
" others.  Whether you decide to try and cure it or see what abilities can be "
"gained from this condition is up to you."
msgstr ""

