#. ~ Description of "Vampiric Amplificator"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/recipes.json
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact will push your vampirism beyond the point of no return when you will use it.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most things you can craft out of warp shards, this item won't be used automatically after you made it, so you can create it then take your time to decide if you really want to do this."
msgstr ""

